🎯 What is the purpose of this project?

The main purpose is to help a company answer:

“Do we have the right products, in the right quantity, at the right location, at the right time?”

Your project analyzes:

📦 Inventory — Do we have too much or too little stock?
🔮 Forecasting — Is predicted demand close to actual demand?
🚚 Logistics — Which transportation methods and suppliers have longer lead times?
🏭 Suppliers — Which suppliers perform better?
🏢 Warehouses — Which warehouses hold the most inventory or generate the most sales?
💰 Sales — Which products/categories/regions generate the most revenue?
